19
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:12,920
[Episode 2]
[The Workplace Isn't Some Kind of Child's Play]

20
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:32,010
Help!

21
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:41,250
Let me open the door.

22
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:49,140
Sorry.

23
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:50,420
It's all my fault.

24
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:52,580
I was taking a shower and didn't hear my phone ring.

25
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:53,980
The landlord told me

26
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:55,860
a new tenant would be coming tonight.

27
00:02:55,860 --> 00:02:57,610
I forgot to inform Tao

28
00:02:57,930 --> 00:02:59,490
and caused her to mistake you for some hooligan.

29
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,920
Sorry.

30
00:03:01,330 --> 00:03:02,490
It's my fault.

31
00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:04,930
I should've waited for her to enter the house before coming up.

32
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:07,420
Actually, I could feel that you were scared,

33
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:08,700
so I didn't enter the lift.

34
00:03:08,930 --> 00:03:09,820
I didn't expect

35
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:11,140
that I would still scare you.

36
00:03:11,490 --> 00:03:12,210
Sorry.

37
00:03:12,210 --> 00:03:12,930
That's not it.

38
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:14,660
I was way too timid.

39
00:03:15,010 --> 00:03:16,490
I probably scared you too.

40
00:03:16,490 --> 00:03:17,330
I even

41
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:19,300
broke two bottles of your sauce.

42
00:03:19,860 --> 00:03:20,820
It's fine.

43
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:22,210
Well,

44
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:24,260
I am Sun Yuanzhu.

45
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:26,700
Sun Yu.

46
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:28,300
Hello.

47
00:03:31,930 --> 00:03:33,010
Shang Zhitao.

48
00:03:33,140 --> 00:03:33,860
Hello.

49
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:39,710
It's normal to have a boy as a flatmate in Beijing.

50
00:03:39,930 --> 00:03:40,730
Don't worry.

51
00:03:41,490 --> 00:03:42,930
I'll interrogate him later.

52
00:03:46,140 --> 00:03:47,170
Wow.

53
00:03:47,170 --> 00:03:48,330
You have so many types of seasoning.

54
00:03:48,330 --> 00:03:49,300
You can cook too?

55
00:03:49,770 --> 00:03:51,040
Just simple meals.

56
00:03:51,170 --> 00:03:52,440
I'll make something for you two if I get the chance.

57
00:03:52,730 --> 00:03:54,470
That's exactly what I'm waiting for.

58
00:03:55,010 --> 00:03:55,930
Do you need any help?

59
00:03:56,730 --> 00:03:57,280
No need.

60
00:03:59,730 --> 00:04:01,930
Do you work at BAT?

61
00:04:03,580 --> 00:04:05,540
Yes. I work in the IT industry.

62
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:07,820
A rising star in the tech industry.

63
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:09,980
I work for an online dating company.

64
00:04:09,980 --> 00:04:11,050
Find me if you need anything.

65
00:04:11,050 --> 00:04:11,610
Sure.

66
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:13,960
Tao.

67
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:16,200
An advertising elite working in Lime.

68
00:04:16,930 --> 00:04:17,660
Lime?

69
00:04:17,690 --> 00:04:18,810
Lime is amazing.

70
00:04:18,810 --> 00:04:19,810
Those who work there are all incredible.

71
00:04:19,810 --> 00:04:20,600
Not at all.

72
00:04:20,810 --> 00:04:21,900
I just got hired.

73
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:23,080
Just a rookie.

74
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,260
When you've survived the initial phase,

75
00:04:25,490 --> 00:04:27,800
you'll be a proven elite.

76
00:04:28,250 --> 00:04:29,380
When I started working,

77
00:04:29,690 --> 00:04:32,370
I spent a whole night at the convenience store entrance editing my slides.

78
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:34,690
I was even mistaken for an oden thief.

79
00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:36,340
An oden thief?

80
00:04:37,690 --> 00:04:38,840
What was your name again?

81
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:41,820
Zhu.

82
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:43,320
Sun Yuanzhu.

83
00:04:44,050 --> 00:04:45,180
Sun Yuanzhu.

84
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:46,490
Sorry.

85
00:04:47,690 --> 00:04:48,930
Is your name from the poem

86
00:04:49,490 --> 00:04:50,690
"My lofty aspirations encompass the world;

87
00:04:50,690 --> 00:04:52,340
My wings yearn to carry me to far-off heights?"

88
00:04:54,370 --> 00:04:55,660
You actually know the poem?

89
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:57,420
My father taught it to me when I was young.

90
00:04:58,250 --> 00:04:59,690
That's amazing.

91
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:00,980
I hereby announce

92
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:03,220
the completion of our temporary

93
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:04,540
three-man home.

94
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,050
It's late. Get your things sorted

95
00:05:06,050 --> 00:05:07,220
and go to bed when you're done.

96
00:05:07,220 --> 00:05:08,100
Tomorrow is Saturday.

97
00:05:08,170 --> 00:05:09,050
Let's talk after we wake up.

98
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:09,690
Sure.

99
00:05:09,690 --> 00:05:10,540
Good night.

100
00:05:13,170 --> 00:05:13,810
After you.

101
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:15,690
After you.

102
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:17,250
After you.

103
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:19,930
I'll go in first.

104
00:05:20,250 --> 00:05:20,930
Sorry.

105
00:05:24,370 --> 00:05:25,170
After her.

106
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:46,960
Boss.

107
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:50,540
We lost the Qipai project.

108
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:53,370
Mr. Lin handed the project to Alex.

109
00:05:53,780 --> 00:05:54,300
What?

110
00:05:54,860 --> 00:05:56,980
Our project has been taken away by Division Two.

111
00:06:02,730 --> 00:06:03,980
Boss, are you listening?

112
00:06:04,170 --> 00:06:05,980
He agreed to the 30% discount and signed the contract?

113
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,300
I guess.

114
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:09,860
What an embarrassment.

115
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,300
I've embarrassed you.

116
00:06:13,730 --> 00:06:14,830
I mean, Alex

117
00:06:15,050 --> 00:06:16,060
is an embarrassment to Lime.

118
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:17,220
Exactly.

119
00:06:17,730 --> 00:06:18,420
You've spent years

120
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:20,170
maintaining Qipai as a client.

121
00:06:20,170 --> 00:06:21,540
We made the proposal

122
00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:22,730
after staying up late for half a month.

123
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:24,860
Now, the project has been taken away from our hands.

124
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:26,340
Boss.

125
00:06:26,340 --> 00:06:27,810
What should we do now?

126
00:06:28,300 --> 00:06:29,100
If we can't

127
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,300
complete this month's KPI,

128
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:31,220
- we will... - Look.

129
00:06:31,810 --> 00:06:32,810
Go and accept

130
00:06:32,810 --> 00:06:34,220
the Mulanshuo e-commerce project.

131
00:06:34,220 --> 00:06:35,810
Didn't you say to reject it?

132
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:38,660
That company has all kinds of issues.

133
00:06:38,810 --> 00:06:40,660
They are even requesting a specific production team.

134
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:41,900
Great.

135
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,980
I hope you have other alternatives.

136
00:06:53,810 --> 00:06:55,420
Which production team has the client requested?

137
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:56,460
Laiyu,

138
00:06:56,730 --> 00:06:58,220
a production team in Guangzhou.

139
00:06:58,220 --> 00:06:59,460
They have a new energy vehicle commercial

140
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:01,300
that went viral in the first half of the year.

141
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:02,900
They are quite popular among the southern media outlets.

142
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:03,730
They are not bad.

143
00:07:04,100 --> 00:07:04,860
Have you contacted them?

144
00:07:04,980 --> 00:07:05,570
I have.

145
00:07:05,570 --> 00:07:06,810
They are very interested in working with us,

146
00:07:06,810 --> 00:07:08,900
but their whole team is based in Guangzhou.

147
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:11,130
Give me the team's profile.

148
00:07:11,130 --> 00:07:12,460
- Sure. - I'll leave the rest to you.

149
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:13,020
Sure.

150
00:07:13,340 --> 00:07:14,020
Boss.

151
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:17,460
All the other employees are working on other projects.

152
00:07:17,540 --> 00:07:18,900
Can I bring Shang Zhitao along

153
00:07:19,220 --> 00:07:20,570
for this project?

154
00:07:21,130 --> 00:07:22,900
She is patient and has a good temper.

155
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:24,020
No one else

156
00:07:24,020 --> 00:07:26,570
in Lime is better than her at this.

157
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:28,860
Luke.

158
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:30,660
I won't quit.

159
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:32,490
Go ahead.

160
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:34,340
I also think she'll be helpful.

161
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:35,980
Helpful?

162
00:07:36,810 --> 00:07:37,730
Honest

163
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:38,660
and single-minded.

164
00:07:39,420 --> 00:07:41,020
How long will she last in the advertising industry?

165
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:45,980
Didn't you tell me

166
00:07:46,220 --> 00:07:47,300
to go ahead?

167
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,720
[20,300 yuan has been deposited]

168
00:08:03,570 --> 00:08:04,460
Mom.

169
00:08:04,610 --> 00:08:05,570
Tao.

170
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:08,570
I transferred 16,000 yuan to you.

171
00:08:08,570 --> 00:08:09,540
Did you receive it?

172
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:11,570
Are you sure it's 16,000 yuan?

173
00:08:11,570 --> 00:08:12,660
Why did I receive

174
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:14,570
20,300 yuan instead?

175
00:08:14,570 --> 00:08:16,220
Did the bank give me extra?

176
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:17,610
When I told your dad

177
00:08:17,610 --> 00:08:19,420
to transfer you some money,

178
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:20,730
he didn't even hesitate.

179
00:08:20,860 --> 00:08:22,980
He would give you a gold mine if he had one,

180
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:25,050
let alone the little bit of money he has now.

181
00:08:26,460 --> 00:08:27,660
Why didn't you give us a call

182
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:28,980
after you arrived?

183
00:08:29,170 --> 00:08:30,660
How are your food and accommodation?

184
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:31,900
Do you have enough money?

185
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,970
Which question should I answer first?

186
00:08:36,810 --> 00:08:38,090
Calm down.

187
00:08:38,090 --> 00:08:39,540
You can find a job slowly

188
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,300
until you find the right one.

189
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:42,570
Don't make do with your job.

190
00:08:42,570 --> 00:08:43,660
If you can't find one, come home.

191
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:44,660
We'll support you.

192
00:08:45,210 --> 00:08:46,300
Coming home is also a good choice.

193
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:49,850
Mom. Dad. I love you both so much.

194
00:08:49,850 --> 00:08:51,300
Don't worry, both of you.

195
00:08:51,330 --> 00:08:53,740
Your daughter has been impressive.

196
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:56,420
I'm now working at the biggest advertising company in China.

197
00:08:56,570 --> 00:09:00,210
Of course, my daughter is impressive.

198
00:09:00,210 --> 00:09:02,570
You joined a large company in Beijing as soon as you graduated.

199
00:09:02,570 --> 00:09:04,420
Their revenue reaches billions of yuan.

200
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:05,140
I'm telling you.

201
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,020
The ancestors

202
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:08,020
of the Shang family

203
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:09,450
are more than proud of you.

204
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:12,540
Do you think an ordinary person is good enough for you?

205
00:09:12,540 --> 00:09:13,380
No.

206
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:14,690
Absolutely not.

207
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,810
I have to go now.

208
00:09:15,810 --> 00:09:16,810
My superior is looking for me.

209
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:19,300
Don't be too exhausted from working.

210
00:09:19,810 --> 00:09:21,810
If your superior dares to bully you,

211
00:09:21,810 --> 00:09:23,330
your mother and I will fly over

212
00:09:23,330 --> 00:09:24,330
to protect you with sticks in our hands.

213
00:09:24,330 --> 00:09:25,330
Got it.

214
00:09:25,330 --> 00:09:26,020
I'm hanging up.

215
00:09:27,090 --> 00:09:28,020
You're already...

216
00:09:28,810 --> 00:09:29,420
She hung up.

217
00:09:31,810 --> 00:09:32,570
Tao,

218
00:09:32,810 --> 00:09:33,810
pack up.

219
00:09:33,810 --> 00:09:34,810
We are going on a business trip.

220
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:35,970
We leave tomorrow morning.

221
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:37,420
Okay.

222
00:09:41,810 --> 00:09:42,570
Come in.

223
00:09:47,810 --> 00:09:49,140
Came to the office on a weekend?

224
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:50,740
It's rare for you to do that.

225
00:09:51,540 --> 00:09:54,620
Alex's group stole your client, Qipai.

226
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:56,420
They're having a celebration dinner tonight.

227
00:09:56,420 --> 00:09:57,970
They asked me to come over and arrange it.

228
00:09:58,450 --> 00:10:00,420
They sell ideas as if they were street vendors.

229
00:10:00,850 --> 00:10:01,970
I suggest you send their group

230
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:03,230
to the market.

231
00:10:04,850 --> 00:10:06,810
It's not a bad idea.

232
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:08,620
I'll try to contact the market later.

233
00:10:10,050 --> 00:10:11,500
Speaking of which,

234
00:10:11,850 --> 00:10:13,140
in three months,

235
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:16,020
the company will appoint one of you two directors

236
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:17,660
as the acting general manager.

237
00:10:18,330 --> 00:10:19,260
Sales KPI

238
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:20,900
is the most important assessment criterion.

239
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:22,260
I think

240
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:24,500
he probably has heard something about it.

241
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:26,810
Otherwise, he wouldn't have

242
00:10:26,810 --> 00:10:28,420
dared to slash his price to steal your client.

243
00:10:29,210 --> 00:10:30,380
I wish him success, then.

244
00:10:36,420 --> 00:10:37,170
Look at this.

245
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,660
[Mulanshuo E-commerce TVC proposal]

246
00:10:41,660 --> 00:10:42,610
[Business Division One]
Mulanshuo?

247
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:46,170
No wonder you are so calm.

248
00:10:46,970 --> 00:10:48,540
Turns out, you've taken the Mulanshuo project.

249
00:10:49,140 --> 00:10:50,420
However, their budget

250
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:52,780
is 20% higher than Qipai's.

251
00:10:53,090 --> 00:10:54,540
This is a huge project.

252
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:56,900
I'm sure Lumi will be very busy.

253
00:10:57,330 --> 00:10:57,930
Oh,

254
00:10:57,930 --> 00:10:59,900
is she getting Shang Zhitao involved in the project, as well?

255
00:11:00,050 --> 00:11:01,420
If you really care about her,

256
00:11:01,900 --> 00:11:03,380
spare her some manpower.

257
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:04,660
It's urgent, and the workload is heavy.

258
00:11:05,090 --> 00:11:06,380
A rookie won't be much help.

259
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:07,810
Got it.

260
00:11:07,970 --> 00:11:09,380
When you're shooting the commercial,

261
00:11:09,380 --> 00:11:10,300
I'll assign some people to help you.

262
00:11:12,780 --> 00:11:15,020
Fine. I won't disturb you any longer.

263
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:17,050
I'll go contact the supermarket now.

264
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:19,260
I'm leaving.

265
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:25,120
[1.2 Core Competitiveness]

266
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,740
[2.1 Main Creative Team (1) Director: Li Wencai]

267
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:28,240
[(2) Main Outdoor Photography: Pan Weihao]

268
00:11:40,930 --> 00:11:42,690
What time is your flight tomorrow?

269
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:45,360
Help me book a ticket.

270
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:56,400
[Guangzhou]

271
00:12:04,050 --> 00:12:05,050
Flora.

272
00:12:05,780 --> 00:12:06,660
You're so early.

273
00:12:07,330 --> 00:12:08,140
Are you studying?

274
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:09,140
I'm just reading.

275
00:12:09,810 --> 00:12:10,950
Luke, good morning.

276
00:12:11,970 --> 00:12:12,470
Morning.

277
00:12:14,050 --> 00:12:14,930
Do you want coffee?

278
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:15,900
I'm going to buy coffee.

279
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:16,900
Let me pay for it.

280
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:17,660
No need.

281
00:12:19,310 --> 00:12:20,930
Don't try to use any street smarts.

282
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:22,260
It doesn't suit you.

283
00:12:33,050 --> 00:12:34,330
This boss of mine

284
00:12:34,620 --> 00:12:35,930
is handsome,

285
00:12:36,780 --> 00:12:38,170
