571
00:25:23,700 --> 00:25:24,850
on this business trip.

572
00:25:26,850 --> 00:25:27,740
If you can't drink,

573
00:25:28,220 --> 00:25:29,300
don't even take a sip.

574
00:25:29,740 --> 00:25:31,370
Not everyone deserves a toast.

575
00:25:33,460 --> 00:25:34,130
All right.

576
00:25:37,980 --> 00:25:39,130
Let me get us a ride.

577
00:25:39,700 --> 00:25:40,300
We'll walk back

578
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:42,500
to get rid of the smell of alcohol.

579
00:26:34,260 --> 00:26:35,050
No need.

580
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:38,460
Put it on.

581
00:26:39,330 --> 00:26:40,050
I feel warm.

582
00:26:48,940 --> 00:26:49,940
Thank you, Luke.

583
00:26:56,220 --> 00:26:57,050
Flora.

584
00:26:58,220 --> 00:27:00,130
If a client asks whether you're single or not next time,

585
00:27:00,740 --> 00:27:01,800
how will you answer?

586
00:27:03,020 --> 00:27:04,330
I'll just be honest

587
00:27:04,500 --> 00:27:05,130
and say I'm single.

588
00:27:06,740 --> 00:27:08,050
Are you trying to tell him

589
00:27:08,330 --> 00:27:09,370
that he has a chance?

590
00:27:15,220 --> 00:27:16,090
Luke,

591
00:27:16,260 --> 00:27:17,810
are you single?

592
00:27:19,260 --> 00:27:20,020
Yes.

593
00:27:20,500 --> 00:27:22,090
Are you also telling me

594
00:27:22,090 --> 00:27:23,220
that I have a chance?

595
00:27:27,570 --> 00:27:29,260
If you're drunk, go back and sleep.

596
00:27:29,850 --> 00:27:30,980
You'll find what you want in your dream.

597
00:28:05,180 --> 00:28:06,370
Luan Nian!

598
00:28:07,980 --> 00:28:08,610
Zang Yao?

599
00:28:16,810 --> 00:28:18,300
Are you surprised?

600
00:28:18,300 --> 00:28:19,570
Why are you here?

601
00:28:19,740 --> 00:28:20,460
What?

602
00:28:20,460 --> 00:28:21,740
Am I not welcome here?

603
00:28:21,850 --> 00:28:22,810
No.

604
00:28:23,330 --> 00:28:25,220
I mean, how do you know I'm here?

605
00:28:25,890 --> 00:28:27,330
Seriously.

606
00:28:27,460 --> 00:28:28,540
If Chen Kuannian hadn't told me

607
00:28:28,540 --> 00:28:29,570
that you were in Guangzhou on a business trip,

608
00:28:29,570 --> 00:28:30,810
I wouldn't have known.

609
00:28:31,130 --> 00:28:32,570
It's an urgent business trip.

610
00:28:32,740 --> 00:28:33,370
I'm in a rush

611
00:28:33,370 --> 00:28:34,540
and will go back tomorrow.

612
00:28:35,180 --> 00:28:37,220
I'm going out to drink with Chen.

613
00:28:37,260 --> 00:28:37,850
Join us for another round.

614
00:28:37,980 --> 00:28:38,570
Let's go.

615
00:28:38,980 --> 00:28:39,780
I'm not going.

616
00:28:40,330 --> 00:28:41,460
I still have important work to do.

617
00:28:42,300 --> 00:28:44,220
Don't drive if you drink.

618
00:28:44,500 --> 00:28:46,780
Ask Chen or your boyfriend to drive you back.

619
00:28:47,300 --> 00:28:49,020
What a party pooper.

620
00:28:49,810 --> 00:28:50,850
We already broke up.

621
00:28:52,300 --> 00:28:53,460
Again?

622
00:28:54,130 --> 00:28:55,890
What? I'm just learning from you.

623
00:28:56,130 --> 00:28:57,570
Of all things, why learn that from me?

624
00:28:58,570 --> 00:28:59,700
Why did you break up?

625
00:29:00,370 --> 00:29:02,260
Why are you acting like my dad?

626
00:29:02,260 --> 00:29:03,570
You ask too many questions.

627
00:29:04,300 --> 00:29:06,020
Enough. Just go back to work.

628
00:29:06,090 --> 00:29:07,020
I'm telling you.

629
00:29:07,020 --> 00:29:09,050
I'm going to Beijing next month.

630
00:29:09,050 --> 00:29:11,020
You must find time to accompany me, no matter what.

631
00:29:11,020 --> 00:29:11,620
All right?

632
00:29:12,050 --> 00:29:12,980
Why are you going back to Beijing?

633
00:29:13,500 --> 00:29:15,130
What? Am I not welcome there?

634
00:29:15,810 --> 00:29:16,810
Of course, you are.

635
00:29:17,050 --> 00:29:18,570
I'll treat you to dinner when you're back.

636
00:29:19,300 --> 00:29:21,220
You two

637
00:29:21,220 --> 00:29:24,020
were walking along the Pearl River late at night.

638
00:29:24,020 --> 00:29:24,610
Tao,

639
00:29:24,740 --> 00:29:26,740
I think something might happen

640
00:29:27,020 --> 00:29:28,890
between you and your boss.

641
00:29:28,890 --> 00:29:30,130
What?

642
00:29:30,300 --> 00:29:31,500
Didn't you say

643
00:29:31,810 --> 00:29:34,020
he helped you deflect drinks and got you out of a tight spot

644
00:29:34,090 --> 00:29:35,810
and gave you his jacket?

645
00:29:38,090 --> 00:29:40,260
That's because he is a gentleman.

646
00:29:40,610 --> 00:29:42,330
Is Luan Nian handsome?

647
00:29:45,050 --> 00:29:47,540
The kind of roguishly handsome type.

648
00:29:47,700 --> 00:29:49,810
Moreover, he has many women around him.

649
00:29:50,810 --> 00:29:51,810
You're right.

650
00:29:51,980 --> 00:29:54,700
A high-quality elite bachelor

651
00:29:54,700 --> 00:29:57,570
will be surrounded by women.

652
00:29:57,740 --> 00:29:59,130
But don't give up.

653
00:29:59,570 --> 00:30:00,810
You aren't bad.

654
00:30:01,090 --> 00:30:03,250
You have a nice body, and you're pretty.

655
00:30:03,700 --> 00:30:05,050
That's enough, Sun Yu.

656
00:30:05,250 --> 00:30:06,420
I still have a report to rush.

657
00:30:06,420 --> 00:30:07,530
I'll talk to you later.

658
00:30:12,280 --> 00:30:13,640
[Luan Nian: Are you not going to return my jacket?]

659
00:30:17,360 --> 00:30:19,760
[Which room are you in?]

660
00:30:30,570 --> 00:30:31,610
Luke.

661
00:30:31,810 --> 00:30:33,660
Sorry for disturbing you so late at night.

662
00:30:33,740 --> 00:30:35,250
Thank you for lending me your jacket.

663
00:30:36,010 --> 00:30:36,940
Come in.

664
00:30:36,940 --> 00:30:37,570
No.

665
00:30:38,010 --> 00:30:39,740
I shouldn't enter your room.

666
00:30:40,180 --> 00:30:41,770
If someone sees us so late at night,

667
00:30:41,770 --> 00:30:42,770
it will be hard to explain.

668
00:30:42,770 --> 00:30:44,250
It'll damage your reputation.

669
00:30:44,770 --> 00:30:46,010
Are you from the past or what?

670
00:30:56,140 --> 00:30:57,380
Give this to Lumi tomorrow morning.

671
00:31:08,610 --> 00:31:10,180
What are you thinking?

672
00:31:11,980 --> 00:31:12,610
I...

673
00:31:14,380 --> 00:31:15,770
I think

674
00:31:16,420 --> 00:31:18,570
it might be inconvenient if someone is in your room.

675
00:31:28,090 --> 00:31:29,700
Am I some sort of

676
00:31:29,700 --> 00:31:30,660
pervert

677
00:31:30,660 --> 00:31:32,330
in your mind?

678
00:31:33,090 --> 00:31:34,500
No.

679
00:31:42,660 --> 00:31:44,220
If you have time to do that,

680
00:31:44,460 --> 00:31:46,290
you should reflect on your work again.

681
00:31:46,290 --> 00:31:47,770
In the workplace, only results can speak for you.

682
00:31:48,090 --> 00:31:49,530
Go back and think about

683
00:31:49,770 --> 00:31:51,290
how to improve.

684
00:31:51,570 --> 00:31:52,060
Go back.

685
00:31:54,900 --> 00:31:56,290
I'll go back and reflect on my work

686
00:31:56,290 --> 00:31:57,290
and send it to you.

687
00:31:57,290 --> 00:31:58,460
Please guide me.

688
00:31:58,810 --> 00:32:00,010
Why are you sending it to me?

689
00:32:00,810 --> 00:32:02,220
Am I your mentor or what?

690
00:32:05,220 --> 00:32:06,050
You're still not leaving?

691
00:32:18,520 --> 00:32:21,800
[Canton Hotel]

692
00:32:23,260 --> 00:32:23,950
It's done, sir.

693
00:32:24,700 --> 00:32:25,250
Thank you.

694
00:32:25,250 --> 00:32:25,900
Boss.

695
00:32:26,260 --> 00:32:26,700
Here you go.

696
00:32:31,460 --> 00:32:31,940
Is it done?

697
00:32:31,940 --> 00:32:32,570
Yes.

698
00:32:33,810 --> 00:32:34,460
Is it done?

699
00:32:36,420 --> 00:32:37,220
Thank you.

700
00:32:37,250 --> 00:32:37,810
You're welcome.

701
00:32:38,180 --> 00:32:39,420
We got the deal,

702
00:32:39,660 --> 00:32:42,700
but we're in trouble again when coming up with a proposal later.

703
00:32:43,090 --> 00:32:44,090
Lumi,

704
00:32:44,330 --> 00:32:46,570
can I become the assistant to the PM for this project?

705
00:32:47,570 --> 00:32:48,460
Sure.

706
00:32:48,740 --> 00:32:49,900
If you think you can handle it, just go for it.

707
00:32:56,290 --> 00:32:57,250
I'm back.

708
00:32:57,700 --> 00:32:58,940
Tao, you're back.

709
00:32:58,940 --> 00:33:00,740
Just in time.

710
00:33:00,740 --> 00:33:01,530
Lei,

711
00:33:02,010 --> 00:33:04,180
I've not seen Shang Zhitao come back for dinner

712
00:33:04,180 --> 00:33:07,250
for a long time.

713
00:33:07,250 --> 00:33:08,330
Shang Zhitao?

714
00:33:08,530 --> 00:33:09,290
Hello.

715
00:33:09,290 --> 00:33:10,010
Lei.

716
00:33:10,010 --> 00:33:10,530
I'm Zhang Lei.

717
00:33:10,530 --> 00:33:11,250
Hello, Lei.

718
00:33:11,250 --> 00:33:13,290
I've finally met our landlord.

719
00:33:14,900 --> 00:33:15,420
Wow,

720
00:33:15,420 --> 00:33:16,460
what a feast.

721
00:33:16,460 --> 00:33:17,180
Sit down, quickly.

722
00:33:18,220 --> 00:33:19,900
I didn't help out at all today.

723
00:33:19,900 --> 00:33:21,220
Let me do the dishes, all right?

724
00:33:21,740 --> 00:33:22,420
How much should I pay?

725
00:33:22,460 --> 00:33:23,460
Who should I transfer to?

726
00:33:23,460 --> 00:33:24,090
No need.

727
00:33:24,090 --> 00:33:25,420
Let Lei and me treat everyone.

728
00:33:25,460 --> 00:33:27,420
We must take care of each other when we're living outside.

729
00:33:28,090 --> 00:33:30,140
Most importantly, it doesn't cost much.

730
00:33:30,420 --> 00:33:31,700
Let's have a toast first

731
00:33:31,700 --> 00:33:33,770
to celebrate our landlord's return.

732
00:33:34,340 --> 00:33:35,700
Welcome!

733
00:33:35,700 --> 00:33:36,700
Thank you, everyone.

734
00:33:38,940 --> 00:33:41,180
Lei, you've been working abroad for two months.

735
00:33:41,180 --> 00:33:42,330
Right?

736
00:33:42,330 --> 00:33:44,420
The project was running for too long.

737
00:33:44,940 --> 00:33:46,010
I've not come home for two months.

738
00:33:46,010 --> 00:33:46,700
Thanks, babe.

739
00:33:46,700 --> 00:33:47,460
I'm so exhausted.

740
00:33:48,330 --> 00:33:50,420
But I can see that you three are getting along well.

741
00:33:50,420 --> 00:33:51,010
Thank you.

742
00:33:51,010 --> 00:33:52,010
Of course.

743
00:33:52,010 --> 00:33:53,420
These two people are nice.

744
00:33:53,700 --> 00:33:54,500
They are

745
00:33:54,500 --> 00:33:56,500
the stars in the sky

746
00:33:56,500 --> 00:33:58,330
compared to those two who only deserve to live in the basement.

747
00:33:58,330 --> 00:33:59,420
Really?

748
00:33:59,610 --> 00:34:00,940
Shang Zhitao,

749
00:34:01,090 --> 00:34:02,250
it's our first meeting.

750
00:34:02,420 --> 00:34:04,700
I didn't prepare any gift for you.

751
00:34:04,740 --> 00:34:05,420
Well,

752
00:34:05,660 --> 00:34:06,330
I'll give you

753
00:34:06,660 --> 00:34:07,940
a discount of 100 yuan on your rent.

754
00:34:08,420 --> 00:34:09,570
Really?

755
00:34:10,640 --> 00:34:12,010
You didn't give me the same favor.

756
00:34:13,170 --> 00:34:14,690
You took care of the house well.

757
00:34:15,170 --> 00:34:16,170
I'll give you a 50-yuan discount.

758
00:34:16,940 --> 00:34:18,170
Not bad.

759
00:34:22,090 --> 00:34:23,210
Everyone will get a 100-yuan discount!

760
00:34:23,940 --> 00:34:24,940
Thank you, Lei.

761
00:34:24,940 --> 00:34:26,940
Thank you, Landlord.

762
00:34:27,460 --> 00:34:28,260
Cheers!

763
00:34:30,650 --> 00:34:31,700
Hurry and eat.

764
00:34:32,610 --> 00:34:33,110
Lei.

765
00:34:33,730 --> 00:34:34,170
Thank you.

766
00:34:34,170 --> 00:34:35,340
You can hold your liquor.

767
00:34:35,340 --> 00:34:36,260
- Lei. - Cheers!

768
00:34:36,260 --> 00:34:37,170
Thanks, Landlord.

769
00:34:37,170 --> 00:34:38,170
The meat is ready.

770
00:34:38,170 --> 00:34:39,690
Do you still want that discount?

771
00:34:48,300 --> 00:34:49,170
Flora,

772
00:34:49,170 --> 00:34:50,780
have you reminded Luke

773
00:34:50,780 --> 00:34:52,010
to approve the business trip expenses?

774
00:34:52,010 --> 00:34:53,090
Why hasn't it been approved yet?

775
00:34:53,300 --> 00:34:54,780
I'm going to make a claim on Monday.

776
00:34:54,820 --> 00:34:56,940
I sent it to him, but he didn't give me a reply.

777
00:34:56,940 --> 00:34:58,300
Rush him again.

778
00:34:58,500 --> 00:35:00,420
Otherwise, just call him.

779
00:35:02,530 --> 00:35:03,780
Sure.

780
00:35:04,730 --> 00:35:05,730
Don't be scared.

781
00:35:05,940 --> 00:35:07,730
Rushing your boss will help you gain experience.

782
00:35:08,010 --> 00:35:08,820
I'm counting on you.

783
00:35:09,090 --> 00:35:09,820
Bye.

784
00:35:30,780 --> 00:35:31,980
Hello, Luke.

785
00:35:31,980 --> 00:35:33,650
[Shang Zhitao]
Sorry for disturbing you this late.

786
00:35:33,650 --> 00:35:35,940
I have a few things to confirm with you.

787
00:35:35,940 --> 00:35:37,980
Also, I need you to approve

788
00:35:37,980 --> 00:35:39,170
an OA budget.

789
00:35:41,170 --> 00:35:42,420
What's the rush for payment?

790
00:35:42,650 --> 00:35:43,650
Even if I approve it at night,

791
00:35:43,820 --> 00:35:45,170
will the finance department pay you?

792
00:35:53,240 --> 00:35:55,840
[Re: Budget Approval - Fund request. Payment approved.]

793
00:35:55,840 --> 00:35:56,520
[Send]

794
00:35:58,200 --> 00:35:59,800
[Luke: Payment approved.]

795
00:36:04,900 --> 00:36:05,900
Thank you.

796
00:36:06,130 --> 00:36:07,010
I've learned a lot.

797
00:36:07,170 --> 00:36:08,260
Thank you for the hard work.

798
00:36:09,690 --> 00:36:11,170
I'll go back and reflect on my work

799
00:36:11,170 --> 00:36:12,170
and send it to you.

800
00:36:12,170 --> 00:36:13,500
Please guide me.

801
00:36:19,460 --> 00:36:21,170
Do you need anything else from me?

802
00:36:25,380 --> 00:36:26,170
There's more,

803
00:36:26,170 --> 00:36:27,340
but it's not urgent.

804
00:36:27,340 --> 00:36:28,530
It's late.

805
00:36:28,530 --> 00:36:30,130
I won't disturb your rest any further.

806
00:36:30,640 --> 00:36:33,520
[Shang Zhitao]

807
00:36:37,440 --> 00:36:38,920
[Luan Nian]

808
00:36:41,380 --> 00:36:42,170
Luke.

809
00:36:43,130 --> 00:36:44,980
Are you going to disturb me tomorrow, then?

810
00:36:46,570 --> 00:36:48,380
I left some documents at the office.

811
00:36:48,380 --> 00:36:49,530
I'm afraid you might not see them.

812
00:36:49,530 --> 00:36:51,010
I'm at the office now.

813
00:36:51,260 --> 00:36:52,820
What else do you need me for?

814
00:36:52,820 --> 00:36:53,650
Tell me everything in one go.

815
00:36:54,650 --> 00:36:55,980
Also,

816
00:36:56,210 --> 00:36:58,820
the filming venue needs your approval.

817
00:36:58,820 --> 00:37:00,130
I sent it to your secretary.

818
00:37:00,130 --> 00:37:01,860
I'll confirm with the client on Monday.

819
00:37:02,650 --> 00:37:03,570
Also,

820
00:37:03,860 --> 00:37:05,860
I sent the filming material and budget

821
00:37:05,860 --> 00:37:08,050
usage progress to you.

822
00:37:08,340 --> 00:37:09,500
They require your approval.

823
00:37:10,010 --> 00:37:11,460
Go and find Jack tomorrow.

824
00:37:13,530 --> 00:37:14,420
Then,

825
00:37:14,860 --> 00:37:16,820
there's nothing else for now.

826
00:37:16,820 --> 00:37:17,530
Sorry

827
00:37:17,900 --> 00:37:18,940
for disturbing you.

828
00:37:20,380 --> 00:37:21,130
It's all right.

829
00:37:21,130 --> 00:37:22,500
Thank you for the hard work.

830
00:37:22,780 --> 00:37:23,860
Good night.

831
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:33,000
[Shang Zhitao]

832
00:37:37,500 --> 00:37:38,380
You're still not hanging up?

833
00:37:38,650 --> 00:37:39,530
Are you eavesdropping?

834
00:37:40,130 --> 00:37:40,860
Workplace etiquette.

835
00:37:40,860 --> 00:37:41,900
The boss should hang up first.

836
00:37:42,340 --> 00:37:43,500
Workplace etiquette?

837
00:37:46,010 --> 00:37:46,860
Fine.

838
00:37:47,380 --> 00:37:48,500
I should have hung up sooner.

839
00:37:56,460 --> 00:37:57,460
Patience

840
00:37:58,010 --> 00:37:59,690
is probably her strength.

841
00:38:05,900 --> 00:38:07,130
Are you still working so late at night?

842
00:38:07,130 --> 00:38:07,780
Yes.

843
00:38:07,780 --> 00:38:09,860
I'm rushing my boss to approve a budget.

844
00:38:10,010 --> 00:38:11,050
How is it? Are you done?

845
00:38:11,050 --> 00:38:11,690
Done.

846
00:38:11,690 --> 00:38:12,570
That's great.

847
00:38:13,130 --> 00:38:13,900
In my opinion,

848
00:38:13,900 --> 00:38:16,460
being in a workplace is like being in a relationship.

849
00:38:16,500 --> 00:38:18,530
The boss tortures me thousands of times,

850
00:38:18,530 --> 00:38:21,130
but I still treat him like my first love.

851
00:38:23,610 --> 00:38:24,530
My experience tells me

852
00:38:24,530 --> 00:38:26,090
that first loves don't end well.

853
00:38:26,380 --> 00:38:28,300
You must not have any feelings

854
00:38:28,300 --> 00:38:30,130
toward your boss.

855
00:38:30,860 --> 00:38:32,170
Don't scare her.

856
00:38:32,170 --> 00:38:33,650
A boss isn't God.

857
00:38:33,650 --> 00:38:35,300
He just has a few more years of experience

858
00:38:35,300 --> 00:38:36,690
compared to you.

859
00:38:36,690 --> 00:38:37,820
You work so hard.

860
00:38:37,860 --> 00:38:39,130
I'm sure your efforts will be seen one day.

861
00:38:39,780 --> 00:38:41,900
I'm not as hardworking as my boss.

862
00:38:41,900 --> 00:38:43,860
He is still working overtime in the office now.

863
00:38:44,130 --> 00:38:46,010
He's talented and hardworking.

864
00:38:46,690 --> 00:38:47,570
Going to work

865
00:38:47,570 --> 00:38:49,500
feels like the college entrance examination for me.

866
00:38:49,500 --> 00:38:50,820
I dare not get a single question wrong.

867
00:38:51,860 --> 00:38:53,010
Working

868
00:38:53,170 --> 00:38:54,610
is not like running a marathon.

869
00:38:55,010 --> 00:38:56,650
You don't have to be on the same path as your boss.

870
00:38:57,130 --> 00:38:58,420
Just be a blade of grass.

871
00:38:59,130 --> 00:39:00,610
Even if he has a temper,

872
00:39:00,780 --> 00:39:02,460
you can still grow on the ground.

873
00:39:02,860 --> 00:39:04,250
Bouncing back after a storm.

874
00:39:06,570 --> 00:39:09,130
A rookie's greatest strength isn't experience,

875
00:39:09,130 --> 00:39:11,010
but the vigor to grow wildly.

876
00:39:11,340 --> 00:39:13,050
Moss flowers as small as a grain of rice

877
00:39:13,130 --> 00:39:14,570
also bloom like the peony.

878
00:39:15,050 --> 00:39:18,010
You are just like a seed now.

879
00:39:18,530 --> 00:39:20,860
No one can stop you once you grow out of the ground.

880
00:39:21,460 --> 00:39:23,500
Well said.

881
00:39:24,010 --> 00:39:25,130
I heard it from a scholar...

882
00:39:25,130 --> 00:39:25,910
I mean, I learned it.

883
00:39:26,300 --> 00:39:27,900
Blooming like the roses or something.

884
00:39:27,900 --> 00:39:29,010
Peony.

885
00:39:29,010 --> 00:39:29,860
Peony.

886
00:39:30,010 --> 00:39:30,450
I'm telling you.

887
00:39:30,450 --> 00:39:32,570
Hiring people isn't like opening a mystery box.

888
00:39:32,570 --> 00:39:34,610
No one will hire you if you don't have some hidden skills.

889
00:39:34,610 --> 00:39:35,340
Exactly.

890
00:39:35,340 --> 00:39:36,130
I can see

891
00:39:36,130 --> 00:39:37,690
that your hidden skills just haven't been developed yet.

892
00:39:37,690 --> 00:39:38,300
Is that so?

893
00:39:38,300 --> 00:39:38,940
That's right.

894
00:39:41,300 --> 00:39:42,010
How great.

895
00:39:42,530 --> 00:39:44,380
If luck can be ranked,

896
00:39:44,380 --> 00:39:46,170
my luck must be ranked first.

897
00:39:46,530 --> 00:39:48,900
No matter how hard my job is,

898
00:39:48,900 --> 00:39:50,610
I still have my friends to support me.

899
00:39:50,900 --> 00:39:52,500
I'm back to my energetic self again.

900
00:39:52,500 --> 00:39:53,610
You're a good student.

901
00:39:53,820 --> 00:39:55,050
Next meal's on you.

902
00:39:56,050 --> 00:39:56,650
No.

903
00:39:57,210 --> 00:39:58,130
I'm not paying.

904
00:39:58,130 --> 00:39:59,210
You'll never amount to much.

905
00:39:59,500 --> 00:40:00,610
Lei.

906
00:40:00,690 --> 00:40:01,500
Next meal's on you.

907
00:40:01,500 --> 00:40:02,500
Don't look at me.

908
00:40:02,500 --> 00:40:03,860
It's still your treat.

909
00:40:03,860 --> 00:40:04,570
Your treat?

910
00:40:04,570 --> 00:40:05,130
My treat?

911
00:40:05,130 --> 00:40:05,690
Your treat.

912
00:40:05,690 --> 00:40:07,010
Mala crawfish.

913
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:14,840
[Lime Advertising]

914
00:40:17,500 --> 00:40:18,340
The coffee machine is over there.

915
00:40:18,340 --> 00:40:19,840
Your office is quite impressive.

916
00:40:24,010 --> 00:40:26,460
I finally realized what's wrong with this.

917
00:40:27,780 --> 00:40:30,420
This proposal lacks a concrete approach to address the pain points.

918
00:40:31,090 --> 00:40:33,090
Didn't you ask me to amend it

919
00:40:33,090 --> 00:40:34,530
to increase the value?

920
00:40:34,530 --> 00:40:35,200
That's right.

921
00:40:35,200 --> 00:40:37,050
This version is too conceptual.

922
00:40:37,050 --> 00:40:37,900
It's too abstract.

923
00:40:37,900 --> 00:40:38,860
Do you understand?

924
00:40:39,690 --> 00:40:42,170
But our direction previously

925
00:40:42,170 --> 00:40:44,650
was focusing on Mulanshuo and Taobao's collaboration

926
00:40:44,650 --> 00:40:46,420
to show the advantage

927
00:40:46,420 --> 00:40:48,340
of fast delivery, powered by their extensive logistics networks.

928
00:40:48,340 --> 00:40:49,980
If we suddenly change to something else,

929
00:40:49,980 --> 00:40:50,730
won't it

930
00:40:50,900 --> 00:40:52,570
create confusion about the project's focus?

931
00:40:52,860 --> 00:40:53,850
Moreover, the whole direction

932
00:40:53,850 --> 00:40:55,100
- is different. - Are you teaching me how to do things?

933
00:40:57,170 --> 00:40:58,690
Regardless of the project's direction,

934
00:40:58,690 --> 00:41:00,530
we must improve it

935
00:41:00,530 --> 00:41:01,900
to make it perfect.

936
00:41:01,900 --> 00:41:03,380
Ask the creative division to come up with a few drafts

937
00:41:03,380 --> 00:41:04,820
so we can compare them.

938
00:41:04,820 --> 00:41:06,860
You are a rookie. You might not know

939
00:41:06,860 --> 00:41:09,340
that creativity comes from making amendments.

940
00:41:09,400 --> 00:41:10,180
Why don't I

941
00:41:10,180 --> 00:41:11,050
ask Luke's opinion?

942
00:41:11,050 --> 00:41:11,860
If you ask your boss about everything,

943
00:41:11,860 --> 00:41:12,680
what's the point of having us?

944
00:41:13,380 --> 00:41:14,420
Besides,

945
00:41:14,420 --> 00:41:16,260
there'll never be a final draft in a good proposal.

946
00:41:16,260 --> 00:41:17,740
It can always be amended before it is shot.

947
00:41:17,740 --> 00:41:18,700
Flora.

948
00:41:19,570 --> 00:41:21,050
Go and ask Luke.

949
00:41:21,050 --> 00:41:22,700
Ask the decision maker.

950
00:41:23,780 --> 00:41:24,700
Lumi, what's the meaning of this?

951
00:41:24,700 --> 00:41:25,700
I mean what I said.

952
00:41:28,090 --> 00:41:30,300
Luke approved this project's creative idea.

953
00:41:30,570 --> 00:41:33,010
If he finds out how you waste his efforts,

954
00:41:33,090 --> 00:41:34,700
who do you think will be in trouble?

955
00:41:35,780 --> 00:41:37,090
A rookie?

956
00:41:37,380 --> 00:41:38,700
Haven't you been a rookie before?

957
00:41:39,260 --> 00:41:40,570
If you keep making amendments,

958
00:41:40,740 --> 00:41:42,570
can you take responsibility

959
00:41:42,780 --> 00:41:43,780
for delaying the progress?

960
00:41:45,570 --> 00:41:46,530
Well,

961
00:41:46,570 --> 00:41:48,050
let me ask Luke.

962
00:41:48,130 --> 00:41:50,050
I'll take responsibility if anything happens.

963
00:41:59,930 --> 00:42:00,610
Come in.

964
00:42:01,570 --> 00:42:02,450
Luke.

965
00:42:06,860 --> 00:42:07,610
Luke.

966
00:42:07,610 --> 00:42:10,780
It's time for the execution phase of the creative idea.

967
00:42:10,780 --> 00:42:12,220
There's a delay in the progress.

968
00:42:12,260 --> 00:42:13,610
There have been ongoing opinions.

969
00:42:13,610 --> 00:42:14,930
Didn't I approve the proposal?

970
00:42:15,260 --> 00:42:16,300
Why are there so many opinions?

971
00:42:16,420 --> 00:42:18,220
That's not an issue.

972
00:42:18,220 --> 00:42:20,130
I'm just worried that our direction is wrong.

973
00:42:21,010 --> 00:42:22,130
How many drafts have been made?

974
00:42:23,090 --> 00:42:24,420
Seven or eight drafts.

975
00:42:24,570 --> 00:42:25,970
Completing a project on schedule

976
00:42:26,220 --> 00:42:28,220
is also an important assessment criterion for a PM.

977
00:42:28,570 --> 00:42:29,450
I know.

978
00:42:29,570 --> 00:42:30,610
It's my mistake.

979
00:42:30,610 --> 00:42:31,970
These are the revision comments.

980
00:42:31,970 --> 00:42:32,700
Do you want to take a look?

981
00:42:32,700 --> 00:42:33,610
I'll follow up on the progress.

982
00:42:33,700 --> 00:42:34,570
No.

983
00:42:35,090 --> 00:42:36,530
Go back and create a work group.

984
00:42:36,530 --> 00:42:38,570
Anyone can raise their opinions in the group.

985
00:42:38,570 --> 00:42:39,930
Every round of communication going forward

986
00:42:39,930 --> 00:42:41,050
must be recorded in an email.

987
00:42:41,490 --> 00:42:43,130
Wouldn't it be too formal

988
00:42:43,450 --> 00:42:45,010
to record every conversation in an email?

989
00:42:47,380 --> 00:42:48,090
Formal?

990
00:42:49,780 --> 00:42:51,050
Is the workplace some kind of child's play?

991
00:42:51,900 --> 00:42:53,090
Having it in writing

992
00:42:53,260 --> 00:42:54,610
is what protects you.

993
00:42:56,650 --> 00:42:57,490
Got it.

994
00:42:57,490 --> 00:42:59,490
Can I add you to the group?

995
00:42:59,490 --> 00:43:00,780
You don't need to speak.

996
00:43:02,050 --> 00:43:04,700
Summarize the work discussed in the group and send it via email.

997
00:43:04,970 --> 00:43:07,420
The email must be concise. Highlight the important points in red.

998
00:43:07,780 --> 00:43:09,050
CC the related people.

999
00:43:09,220 --> 00:43:09,860
Got it.

1000
00:43:10,180 --> 00:43:11,490
I'll do as you say.

1001
00:43:13,780 --> 00:43:15,700
The golden rule of workplace communication

1002
00:43:16,380 --> 00:43:18,340
is that whoever proposes must take responsibility.

1003
00:43:19,010 --> 00:43:21,490
The person with an opinion must provide a solution.

1004
00:43:22,700 --> 00:43:24,900
What if they just mention it casually?

1005
00:43:25,700 --> 00:43:26,860
Get him to shut up, then.

1006
00:43:26,900 --> 00:43:28,220
No need for nonsense in the workplace.

1007
00:43:28,450 --> 00:43:29,650
You only need results.

1008
00:43:30,490 --> 00:43:32,180
I got it. Thank you.

1009
00:43:32,380 --> 00:43:33,340
I've learned something else.

1010
00:43:33,700 --> 00:43:34,860
Don't thank me just yet.

1011
00:43:35,180 --> 00:43:37,490
Have you prepared yourself for the commercial shoot?

1012
00:43:38,860 --> 00:43:40,380
Can I really go there?

1013
00:43:40,490 --> 00:43:41,700
Lumi recommended you.

1014
00:43:42,490 --> 00:43:43,700
She specifically requested that you go.

1015
00:43:44,050 --> 00:43:45,970
This time, the filming location is in the mountains.

1016
00:43:46,220 --> 00:43:47,130
The conditions are quite harsh.

1017
00:43:47,220 --> 00:43:47,860
Can you do it?

1018
00:43:47,860 --> 00:43:48,530
I can.

1019
00:43:48,780 --> 00:43:49,930
I don't mind the dirty work.

1020
00:43:54,860 --> 00:43:56,780
Handling the dirty work isn't something to brag about.

1021
00:43:56,860 --> 00:43:57,900
You can do all the work,

1022
00:43:57,970 --> 00:43:59,300
but without the result, it still means nothing.

1023
00:44:00,320 --> 00:44:01,530
- Because... - Only results speak for you.

1024
00:44:02,130 --> 00:44:02,900
I understand.

1025
00:44:07,130 --> 00:44:08,530
I'll charge you a tuition fee next time.

1026
00:44:10,970 --> 00:44:12,260
Goodbye, Luke.

1027
00:44:16,650 --> 00:44:18,010
Hello. Can I clean this room?

1028
00:44:18,010 --> 00:44:18,750
Sure.

1029
00:44:27,780 --> 00:44:28,900
What is this?

1030
00:44:38,780 --> 00:44:40,340
It's probably from the typewriter.

1031
00:44:40,490 --> 00:44:41,420
It's probably useless now.

1032
00:44:41,900 --> 00:44:43,140
No, it's not. Give it to me.

1033
00:44:43,260 --> 00:44:43,900
Okay.

1034
00:44:44,380 --> 00:44:45,380
Thanks, Madam.

1035
00:45:21,610 --> 00:45:22,930
How dare you

1036
00:45:23,130 --> 00:45:24,610
wear my man's clothes?

1037
00:45:26,490 --> 00:45:27,180
I...

1038
00:45:27,180 --> 00:45:28,050
I did not.

1039
00:45:56,120 --> 00:45:59,160
♪One look is all it takes to find the right person♪

1040
00:45:59,160 --> 00:46:02,000
♪One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love♪

1041
00:46:03,000 --> 00:46:06,960
♪Whatever remains will be the proof♪

1042
00:46:10,240 --> 00:46:13,600
♪If it never crosses your mind♪

1043
00:46:13,600 --> 00:46:17,320
♪The tide as I turn back♪

1044
00:46:17,320 --> 00:46:21,640
♪Is just formless attraction♪

1045
00:46:23,200 --> 00:46:28,520
♪Your silhouette is closing in♪

1046
00:46:30,360 --> 00:46:35,960
♪Your breathing grows clear♪

1047
00:46:37,520 --> 00:46:41,880
♪Too many distractions in this world♪

1048
00:46:41,880 --> 00:46:46,600
♪I would rather forget myself♪

1049
00:46:46,880 --> 00:46:51,040
♪Just this moment♪

1050
00:46:51,680 --> 00:46:55,080
♪One look is all it takes to find the right person♪

1051
00:46:55,080 --> 00:46:58,000
♪One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love♪

1052
00:46:58,840 --> 00:47:03,040
♪If you miss it, just save the traces♪

1053
00:47:06,000 --> 00:47:09,760
♪If your tears fall on their own♪

1054
00:47:09,760 --> 00:47:13,080
♪Followed by our hearts beating to the same rhythm♪

1055
00:47:13,200 --> 00:47:15,360
♪Will you listen to it♪

1056
00:47:15,400 --> 00:47:19,480
♪Or will you reply to me in silence?♪

1057
00:47:19,520 --> 00:47:24,440
♪Your silhouette is closing in♪

1058
00:47:26,400 --> 00:47:32,600
♪Your breathing grows clear♪

1059
00:47:33,400 --> 00:47:37,920
♪Too many distractions in this world♪

1060
00:47:38,000 --> 00:47:42,640
♪I would rather forget myself♪

1061
00:47:42,720 --> 00:47:47,680
♪All I want is to lose myself in this moment♪

1062
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:54,120
♪Your aloofness masks your vulnerability♪

1063
00:47:55,040 --> 00:48:01,200
♪I hide my nervousness in the corner♪

1064
00:48:02,280 --> 00:48:06,720
♪Too many hurdles in this world♪

1065
00:48:06,760 --> 00:48:10,880
♪Even one moment can keep us warm♪

1066
00:48:11,080 --> 00:48:16,880
♪Just this moment♪

1067
00:48:17,480 --> 00:48:20,800
♪All right?♪
